Attribution

This project's printing protocol implementation benefited from ideas and
findings published in thermoprint (https://github.com/tomLadder/thermoprint)
by tomLadder, licensed under the MIT License. Borrowed elements include:
serpentine Floyd-Steinberg dithering, BLE packet pacing and per-model packet
size capping, credit starvation recovery, initial credit wait, preamble/bulk
print splitting, the 10 FF 40 status command, Marklife thickness-based
density command and keyboard/UX patterns (undo/redo, command palette,
quick-add shortcuts). The underlying protocol was independently reverse-
engineered by both projects from the same vendor's Android applications.
